-- Past the hundredth column, a line break that cannot shorten the line is
-- not made (language.md §11.15): a hole holding a lone name keeps its `}`,
-- and an opening tag with no attributes keeps its `>`.
name model =
    <p>
        A sentence that is long enough that the hole right after it runs past the hundredth column {model.name}
    </p>


